guide forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains
title Redridge Mountains
faction Alliance
levels 20-23
zone Redridge Mountains
next forever/alliance/05-duskwood

# Visit 4 of the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export,
# 20.5 to 22.7): the boat from Auberdine to Stormwind, the road east through
# Elwynn, Redridge, then south to Darkshire.
#
# Flow: Stormwind (training) -> Elwynn road -> Three Corners -> Lakeridge
# Highway (flight path) -> Lakeshire (hearth, every quest giver) -> the
# sunken chest -> the gnoll hills toward Three Corners, Bellygrub -> Deputy
# Feldon -> Lakeshire -> the lake murlocs, Alther's Mill, Galardell Valley ->
# hearth -> Render's Valley and Keeshan -> Lakeshire -> Duskwood.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - The simulator took Lakeshire's quests in two batches (20.5 and 21.5) and
#   walked to Galardell Valley twice (Fangore at 21.4, the pendants at 22.4);
#   here every quest but Fangore's is taken on arrival and Galardell is one
#   trip. The Fangore poster (180, quest level 26) is red at 20: it is taken
#   at the second Lakeshire stop, around 21, right before the trip east.
# - Alther's Mill (98386, Forever) is taken from Foreman Oslow when The
#   Everstill Bridge (89) is handed in, at the second Lakeshire stop: he
#   offers it only then (two Wowhead Forever comments; the quest data has no
#   prerequisite for it, #51). The tarantulas are still killed on the trip
#   east.
# - The Lakeshire flight path and hearth (listed at the end of Darkshore in
#   the export) are taken on arrival. The Darkshire flight path and hearth
#   the export lists at the end of this visit belong to the Duskwood guide.
# - Left out, accepted but never turned in on the route: The Price of Shoes
#   (118, Smith Argus in Goldshire) and Theocritus' Retrieval (178, a pendant
#   drop for the Tower of Azora).
# - Refresh (2026): Expanding Horizons (97914, from 03-darkshore) is handed
#   to Baros Alexston at the Stormwind stop; his reply, Making Do (97926),
#   goes back to Auberdine in 06-ashenvale. The new consensus visits
#   Redridge later (25-26, after the Wetlands); this guide keeps the old
#   place at 21-23, where its quests are not grey, and the zone order of
#   the guides it chains with.
# - Lakeshire on arrival: Oslow, Marris, Conacher, the docks (Baren, Wiley),
#   then Breanna and Martie at the west end, one sweep instead of crossing
#   town twice.
#
# Class quests at the Stormwind stop (about level 21): Rogues take Mathias and
# the Defias (2360, Poisons; finished at the end of 05-duskwood), Warlocks
# Devourer of Souls (1716, the Succubus; carried to Takar the Seer in
# 07-thousand-needles), Priests their level 20 spell: Arcane Feedback (5676,
# Human, here), Chastise (5645, Dwarf) and Contingency Plan (94819,
# Gnome) for Ironforge in 06-ashenvale, Elune's Grace (5673, Night Elf) for
# Darnassus on arrival in Auberdine (06-ashenvale). Night Elf Druids fetch
# the Westfall half pendant for Trial of the Sea Lion (272). Train in
# Stormwind on the way; Shamans take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge for theirs.
# Paladins: at 20 Duthorian Rall (Human) or Tiza Battleforge (Dwarf) starts
# The Tome of Valor (1793/1794), the way to Verigan's Fist: three dungeons and
# an escort, the Class guide forever/class/paladin/verigans-fist.
#
# Not taken: Tharil'zun, Shadow Magic, Wanted: Gath'Ilzogg and Morganth (19,
# 115, 169, 249: elite targets), Blackrock Blockade (98387) and the
# Speaking of Fortitude and Theocritus chains (343+, 94, 248): not on the
# route. Underbelly Scales and Howling in the Hills (122, 126) need The
# Price of Shoes (118, Goldshire turn-in) and A Baying of Gnolls (124)
# first: skipped. The Defias Brotherhood (65), from Westfall, is turned in to
# Wiley the Black in Lakeshire; its follow-up (132) leads back to Westfall:
# not taken.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind and the road

step Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The Auberdine boat docks at Stormwind Harbor. Walk up into the city for training and Baros Alexston, then leave by the main gate and follow the road east through Elwynn Forest.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid -- Level 18 and 20 spells
  turnin 97914                                -- Baros Alexston: Thundris' letter from Auberdine
  accept 97926                                -- For Thundris Windweaver, on the return to Auberdine (06-ashenvale)
  vendor nearest

step Shaman training
  only Shaman
  zone Ironforge
  tip Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back.
  train class

step Stormwind class quests
  only Priest,Rogue,Warlock
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Master Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in Old Town, Gakin the Darkbinder in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar in the Mage Quarter, High Priestess Laurena in the Cathedral of Light.
  accept 2360 only Rogue                      -- Master Mathias Shaw: Agent Kearnen in Westfall takes it, at the end of Duskwood
  accept 1716 only Warlock                    -- Gakin the Darkbinder: Takar the Seer in the Barrens takes it, later
  accept 5676 only Human,Priest               -- High Priestess Laurena
  turnin 5676 only Human,Priest               -- Arcane Feedback
  accept 5645 only Dwarf,Priest               -- High Priestess Laurena: High Priest Rohan in Ironforge takes it, later
  accept 94819 npc 376 only Gnome,Priest      -- High Priestess Laurena: High Priestess Mims in Ironforge takes it, later
  accept 5673 only NightElf,Priest            -- High Priestess Laurena: Priestess Alathea in Darnassus takes it, later

step Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Westfall
  tip Fly to Sentinel Hill and ride north-west to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies on the sea floor off the shore. Then ride east along the road through Elwynn to Redridge.
  fly "Sentinel Hill"
  collect 15882 x1                            -- Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance: the Strange Lockbox

step Three Corners
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip The road from Elwynn enters Redridge at Three Corners. Guard Parker stands where the roads to Redridge and Duskwood meet.
  accept 244                                  -- Guard Parker

step Lakeridge Highway
  tip Follow the road along the south shore of Lake Everstill to the gryphon master. Deputy Feldon and Guard Howe stand by the road next to her.
  getfp "Lakeshire"
  turnin 244                                  -- Deputy Feldon
  accept 246
  accept 98407
  accept 128                                  -- Guard Howe

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lakeshire

step Lakeshire
  tip Cross the long bridge north into town. Foreman Oslow and Marshal Marris stand at the north end of the bridge, Bailiff Conacher in the town hall, Dockmaster Baren and Wiley the Black on the docks, Chef Breanna at the inn, Martie Jainrose in her garden at the west end.
  sethome "Lakeshire"
  accept 125                                  -- Foreman Oslow
  accept 20                                   -- Marshal Marris
  accept 91                                   -- Bailiff Conacher
  accept 150                                  -- Dockmaster Baren
  accept 127
  turnin 65                                   -- Wiley the Black, by the docks
  accept 92                                   -- Chef Breanna
  accept 34                                   -- Martie Jainrose

step Sunken Chest
  tip Swim east from the bridge into Lake Everstill; the chest lies on the lake bed.
  collect 1309 quest 125                      -- Oslow's Toolbox
  turnin 125                                  -- Foreman Oslow
  accept 89

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West of the lake

step Gnolls toward Three Corners
  tip Redridge Mongrels and other gnolls hold the hills east of Three Corners, north of the road; Redridge Thrashers prowl among them, Poachers camp south of the road. Dire Condors and Great Goretusks roam the same hills.
  kill 423 quest 246                          -- Redridge Mongrel
  kill 424 quest 246                          -- Redridge Poacher
  collect 280911 quest 98407                  -- Spiked Collar: Redridge Thrashers
  collect 2856 quest 89                       -- Iron Pike
  collect 1013 quest 89                       -- Iron Rivet
  collect 1080 quest 92                       -- Tough Condor Meat
  collect 2296 quest 92                       -- Great Goretusk Snout

step Bellygrub
  tip Bellygrub (level 24) roots around the pen just west of Lakeshire. Pull him away from the other boars and fight at full health.
  collect 3631 quest 34                       -- Bellygrub's Tusk

step Deputy Feldon
  turnin 246
  turnin 98407

step Lakeshire
  turnin 89                                   -- Foreman Oslow
  accept 98386                                -- Foreman Oslow: after The Everstill Bridge
  turnin 34                                   -- Martie Jainrose
  accept 180 lvl 21                           -- The Wanted poster by the inn: Lieutenant Fangore, in Galardell Valley

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East of the lake

step Lake murlocs
  tip Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore east of the bridge. Any of them can carry a Spotted Sunfish or a fin.
  collect 1467 quest 127                      -- Spotted Sunfish
  collect 1468 quest 150                      -- Murloc Fin

step Alther's Mill
  tip Greater Tarantulas crawl on the slopes around the mill north-east of the lake; Blackrock Renegades hold the mill itself.
  kill 505 quest 98386                        -- Greater Tarantula
  collect 1081 quest 92                       -- Crisp Spider Meat
  collect 3014 quest 20 @55.9,43.6 live       -- Battleworn Axe: the Blackrock Renegades at the mill

step Galardell Valley
  tip East past the mill and across the river. Shadowhide gnolls fill the valley; Lieutenant Fangore (26, well above you) leads them at its north end: clear his escort first and fight him at full health. Stay out of Stonewatch Keep to the south: its orcs are elite.
  collect 1075 quest 91                       -- Shadowhide Pendant: any Shadowhide gnoll
  collect 3632 quest 180                      -- Lieutenant Fangore

step Back to Lakeshire
  hearth "Lakeshire"
  turnin 150                                  -- Dockmaster Baren
  turnin 127
  turnin 92                                   -- Chef Breanna
  turnin 98386                                -- Foreman Oslow
  turnin 20                                   -- Marshal Marris
  turnin 91                                   -- Bailiff Conacher
  turnin 180                                  -- Magistrate Solomon, in the town hall
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Render's Valley

step Render's Valley
  tip Head north out of Lakeshire up the Redridge Canyons to Render's Valley. Blackrock Champions camp in the valley.
  kill 435 quest 128                          -- Blackrock Champion

step Corporal Keeshan
  tip Keeshan hides at the very north end of the valley, by the Burning Steppes border. Escort him down to Lakeshire; Blackrock orcs ambush you on the way.
  accept 219                                  -- Corporal Keeshan
  complete 219

step Lakeshire
  turnin 219                                  -- Marshal Marris
  turnin 128                                  -- Guard Howe, by the gryphons south of the bridge
  note Duskwood is next: follow the road west to Three Corners, then south to Darkshire.
